            "review_title": "Review at Gather Village",
            "review_text": "Kirsten M\nAdelaide Hills, Australia21 contributions\n0\nCame for a massage, stayed for lunch, manicure and pedicure!\nMay 2023 • Solo\nPopped in to see if I could get a massage, and Huong gives a fantastic Swedish massage. Whilst waiting to go in I met the lovely general manager Joanna and she kindly organised me a manicure and pedicure with time to enjoy lunch in between. It’s all in a gorgeous old French villa. Excellent and friendly service and delicious healthy food (plus they know how to store their wines properly, which is not that common in Vietnam). Leaving reinvigorated. What a perfect last day of my trip.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 4, 2023",
