            "review_text": "robarchibald2017\nHong Kong, China40 contributions\n1\nI Gather the Order was Too Complex? Skip this place.\nApr 2023 • Couples\nWe had higher expectations of this place. Way off. Unless you are vying to be an insta star don’t bother. Go across the street to Bao Wow. That place is great. Extremely slow service and food comes at a snails pace. I think they are far too busy worrying about their other enterprises. They should choose what they want to be. My food was bland and the chicken had the sinew still attached. Food came two plates at at time and none of it was particularly good. Good teas. Lots of people absorbed with taking selfies. The ‘manager’ stood around looking nice but really doing nothing. Don’t go for the food. Don’t go for the vibe. Sit outside and watch the free ‘fashion’ show. You can do much better.\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2023",
